Description: limit the frame rate to keep the original speed
 The animation advances by a fixed step at each frame, without any timer.
 The author noted in martigan.txt that the intro already ran way too
 fast on a 2.8 GHz CPU; on current hardware it is unwatchable.
 Request vsync and cap the frame rate to DEMO_FPS (60 by default) with
 SDL_GetTicks()/SDL_Delay(), which also works when vsync is ignored or
 the display runs above 60 Hz.
 Also initialise the camera position used before the first frame is
 computed, which was read uninitialised.
